# Files excluded from Sphinx assessments before content is read.
# Supports *, **, ?, leading /, trailing /, and local ! exceptions.
# Built-in sensitive files, global ignores, and config exclusions cannot be restored.
# .env/.env.*, private keys, and common credentials files are always excluded.

# --- Unity: files the editor writes itself (serialized YAML, not hand-written code) ---
unity/RubikApp/ProjectSettings/
unity/RubikApp/Packages/packages-lock.json
**/*.meta
**/*.unity
**/*.asset
**/*.mat
**/*.inputactions
unity/RubikApp/.vsconfig

# --- Binary and third-party assets ---
unity/RubikApp/Assets/Resources/Fonts/
**/*.ttf
**/*.otf
**/*.png
**/*.jpg

# --- Build output and solver DLLs copied by unity/sync-solver.ps1 (normally git-ignored anyway) ---
unity/RubikApp/Builds/
unity/RubikApp/Assets/Plugins/Rubik/
**/bin/
**/obj/

# --- Boilerplate with nothing to understand ---
**/nuget.config
LICENSE.txt
